{"text":"Bottom power means that a woman simply has a good root to tap into from time to time. Somebody else's power. And then of course we have to wonder what happens when that somebody else is in a bad mood or sick or impotent. Some people will say that a woman being subordinate to a man is our culture. But culture is constantly changing. I have beautiful twin nieces who are 15 and even legos. If they had been born 100 years ago, they would have been taken away and killed because it was our culture. It was a culture to kill twins. So what is the point of culture? I mean, there's the decorative, the dancing, but also culture really is about preservation and continuity of a people. In my family, I am the child who is most interested in the story of who we are in our traditions and the knowledge of ancestral lands. My brothers are not as interested as I am, but I cannot participate.","words":[{"text":"Bottom","start":1.08,"end":1.66},{"text":"power","start":1.66,"end":1.96},{"text":"means","start":1.96,"end":2.28},{"text":"that","start":2.28,"end":2.62},{"text":"a","start":2.62,"end":2.8},{"text":"woman","start":2.8,"end":3.16},{"text":"simply","start":3.16,"end":4.52},{"text":"has","start":4.52,"end":4.72},{"text":"a","start":4.72,"end":4.86},{"text":"good","start":4.86,"end":5.02},{"text":"root","start":5.02,"end":5.34},{"text":"to","start":5.34,"end":5.58},{"text":"tap","start":5.58,"end":5.88},{"text":"into","start":5.88,"end":6.28},{"text":"from","start":6.28,"end":6.52},{"text":"time","start":6.52,"end":6.7},{"text":"to","start":6.7,"end":6.86},{"text":"time","start":6.86,"end":7.14,"punct":"."},{"text":"Somebody","start":7.32,"end":7.5},{"text":"else's","start":7.5,"end":8.06},{"text":"power","start":8.06,"end":8.34,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":9.86,"end":9.86},{"text":"then","start":9.86,"end":10.0},{"text":"of","start":10.0,"end":10.12},{"text":"course","start":10.12,"end":10.3},{"text":"we","start":10.3,"end":10.44},{"text":"have","start":10.44,"end":